# E §10: explain of an as if prints "the pins with their values (a pin given by an expression, with its derivation
# outside the as if), and the derivation inside them beside the one outside".  An ask's `with` pins set the line's
# world (L §5.18), an as if over it (e1); a def's `tax as if {income = other_income}` is one inside a derivation (e2),
# its pin given by an expression whose row is derived outside the as if.  tax = income * rate (0.1): pinned 500.00
# PLN gives 50 PLN, the base 1 000.00 PLN gives 100 PLN, other_income 2 000.00 PLN gives 200 PLN (a money times a num
# is a num PLN, L §3.2).  Layout: this interpreter's; each cause prints once (L §5.18).
=== m.tally
model a
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "ustawa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input income: money PLN
input other_income: money PLN
input rate: num

def tax: num PLN = income * rate at reader
def alt: num PLN = tax as if {income = other_income} at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  income = 1 000.00 PLN "pit"
  other_income = 2 000.00 PLN "pit"
  rate = 0.1 "art. 27"

ask e1: explain tax with income = 500.00 PLN law 2026-06-30
ask e2: explain alt law 2026-06-30
=== expect
e1: 50 PLN
  [1] the pins, evaluated outside them
    [2] pin income = 500.00 PLN
  [3] inside the pins: 50 PLN
    [4] tax = 50 PLN, law date 2026-06-30
        rule base: won
          [5] row v:rate = 0.1
              version v, source s, "ustawa", locator "art. 27", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
  [6] outside the pins: 100 PLN
    [7] tax = 100 PLN, law date 2026-06-30
        rule base: won
          [8] row v:income = 1 000.00 PLN
              version v, source s, "ustawa", locator "pit", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
          (v:rate: see [5])
  pinned: income = 500.00 PLN
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-10-20
e2: 200 PLN
  [1] alt = 200 PLN, law date 2026-06-30
      rule base: won
        [2] as if {...}
          [3] the pins, evaluated outside the as if
            [4] row v:other_income = 2 000.00 PLN
                version v, source s, "ustawa", locator "pit", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
            [5] pin income = 2 000.00 PLN
          [6] inside the as if: 200 PLN
            [7] tax = 200 PLN, law date 2026-06-30
                rule base: won
                  [8] row v:rate = 0.1
                      version v, source s, "ustawa", locator "art. 27", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
          [9] outside the as if: 100 PLN
            [10] tax = 100 PLN, law date 2026-06-30
                rule base: won
                  [11] row v:income = 1 000.00 PLN
                      version v, source s, "ustawa", locator "pit", governs 2026-01-01.., known 2026-01-01
                  (v:rate: see [8])
  pinned: income = 2 000.00 PLN
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-10-20
